{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "file-input",
  "title": "File input",
  "group": "Inputs",
  "order": 11,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A drop zone with a real Choose button, and one row per chosen file that shows its size, upload progress, errors and a way to remove it. The button is the main path; dropping is a shortcut.",
    "id": "Zona lepas dengan tombol Pilih sungguhan, dan satu baris per berkas terpilih yang menampilkan ukuran, progres unggah, galat, dan cara menghapusnya. Tombol adalah jalur utama; menjatuhkan berkas hanya jalan pintas."
  },
  "titleId": "File input",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Drop zone with file rows",
        "desc": "Choose a file (or drag one over the zone). Each file becomes a row; uploading rows show a thin bar, finished rows a remove button, failed rows say why and offer retry.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"drop\" ondragover=\"event.preventDefault(); this.classList.add('is-over');\" ondragleave=\"this.classList.remove('is-over');\" ondrop=\"event.preventDefault(); this.classList.remove('is-over'); const i = this.querySelector('input'); i.files = event.dataTransfer.files; i.dispatchEvent(new Event('change'));\">\n    <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">upload_file</span>\n    <span class=\"empty__title\">Drop your answer sheets here</span>\n    <span class=\"empty__body\">PDF or image, up to 10 MB each</span>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"margin-top: 8px;\" onclick=\"this.nextElementSibling.click()\">Choose files</button>\n    <input type=\"file\" multiple accept=\".pdf,image/*\" hidden aria-label=\"Answer sheets\" onchange=\"const list = document.getElementById('fi-list'); [...this.files].forEach((f) => { const li = document.createElement('li'); li.className = 'file-row'; li.innerHTML = document.getElementById('fi-tpl').innerHTML; li.querySelector('.file-row__name').textContent = f.name; li.querySelector('.file-row__meta').textContent = (f.size / 1048576).toFixed(1) + ' MB'; list.append(li); }); this.value = '';\">\n  </div>\n  <template id=\"fi-tpl\"><span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span></span><span class=\"file-row__body\"><span class=\"file-row__name\"></span><span class=\"file-row__meta\"></span></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Remove file\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span></button></template>\n  <ul id=\"fi-list\" aria-label=\"Chosen files\">\n    <li class=\"file-row\">\n      <span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span></span>\n      <span class=\"file-row__body\"><span class=\"file-row__name\">tryout-3-answers.pdf</span><span class=\"file-row__meta\">2.4 MB · Uploaded</span></span>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Remove tryout-3-answers.pdf\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"file-row\">\n      <span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">image</span></span>\n      <span class=\"file-row__body\"><span class=\"file-row__name\">page-2-photo.jpg</span><span class=\"file-row__meta\">1.1 MB of 3.0 MB · 37%</span><span class=\"progress progress--thin\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Uploading page-2-photo.jpg\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"37\"><span class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.37);\"></span></span></span>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Cancel upload of page-2-photo.jpg\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"file-row is-error\">\n      <span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">error</span></span>\n      <span class=\"file-row__body\"><span class=\"file-row__name\">essay-draft.pdf</span><span class=\"file-row__meta\">Upload failed. Check your connection and retry.</span></span>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Retry essay-draft.pdf\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"drop\">\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">upload_file</span>\n  <span class=\"empty__title\">Drop your answer sheets here</span>\n  <span class=\"empty__body\">PDF or image, up to 10 MB each</span>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\">Choose files</button>\n  <input type=\"file\" multiple accept=\".pdf,image/*\" hidden aria-label=\"Answer sheets\">\n</div>\n<ul aria-label=\"Chosen files\">\n  <li class=\"file-row\">\n    <span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">image</span></span>\n    <span class=\"file-row__body\">\n      <span class=\"file-row__name\">page-2-photo.jpg</span>\n      <span class=\"file-row__meta\">1.1 MB of 3.0 MB · 37%</span>\n      <span class=\"progress progress--thin\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Uploading page-2-photo.jpg\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"37\"><span class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.37);\"></span></span>\n    </span>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Cancel upload of page-2-photo.jpg\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"file-row is-error\">…<span class=\"file-row__meta\">Upload failed. Check your connection and retry.</span>…</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- Your code: the button calls input.click(); dragover adds .is-over, dragleave and drop remove it; each file becomes a row. -->"
      },
      {
        "title": "One file, progress around the edge",
        "desc": "For a single upload, the zone traces its own edge and shows a percent pill; the trace turns green at 100 %. Press Upload.",
        "html": "<div class=\"drop\" id=\"fi-drop\" style=\"max-width: 520px; width: 100%;\">\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">cloud_upload</span>\n  <span class=\"empty__title\">thesis-final.pdf</span>\n  <span class=\"empty__body\">8.6 MB</span>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"margin-top: 8px;\" onclick=\"const d = document.getElementById('fi-drop'); import('../../js/lds.js').then((m) => { m.uploadReset(d); let p = 0; const t = setInterval(() => { p += 4 + Math.random() * 10; m.uploadProgress(d, Math.min(p, 100)); if (p >= 100) clearInterval(t); }, 220); });\">Upload</button>\n</div>",
        "code": "import { uploadProgress, uploadReset } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n\nxhr.upload.onprogress = (e) => uploadProgress(drop, (e.loaded / e.total) * 100);\n// Starting again: uploadReset(drop)"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Zona lepas dengan baris berkas",
        "desc": "Pilih berkas (atau seret ke atas zona). Setiap berkas menjadi satu baris; baris yang mengunggah menampilkan bilah tipis, baris selesai menampilkan tombol hapus, baris gagal menyebut alasannya dan menawarkan coba lagi.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"drop\" ondragover=\"event.preventDefault(); this.classList.add('is-over');\" ondragleave=\"this.classList.remove('is-over');\" ondrop=\"event.preventDefault(); this.classList.remove('is-over'); const i = this.querySelector('input'); i.files = event.dataTransfer.files; i.dispatchEvent(new Event('change'));\">\n    <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">upload_file</span>\n    <span class=\"empty__title\">Lepaskan dokumen persyaratan di sini</span>\n    <span class=\"empty__body\">PDF atau gambar, masing-masing paling besar 10 MB</span>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"margin-top: 8px;\" onclick=\"this.nextElementSibling.click()\">Pilih berkas</button>\n    <input type=\"file\" multiple accept=\".pdf,image/*\" hidden aria-label=\"Dokumen persyaratan\" onchange=\"const list = document.getElementById('fi-list'); [...this.files].forEach((f) => { const li = document.createElement('li'); li.className = 'file-row'; li.innerHTML = document.getElementById('fi-tpl').innerHTML; li.querySelector('.file-row__name').textContent = f.name; li.querySelector('.file-row__meta').textContent = (f.size / 1048576).toFixed(1) + ' MB'; list.append(li); }); this.value = '';\">\n  </div>\n  <template id=\"fi-tpl\"><span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span></span><span class=\"file-row__body\"><span class=\"file-row__name\"></span><span class=\"file-row__meta\"></span></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Hapus berkas\" onclick=\"this.parentElement.remove()\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span></button></template>\n  <ul id=\"fi-list\" aria-label=\"Berkas terpilih\">\n    <li class=\"file-row\">\n      <span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span></span>\n      <span class=\"file-row__body\"><span class=\"file-row__name\">ktp-pemohon.pdf</span><span class=\"file-row__meta\">2,4 MB · Terunggah</span></span>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Hapus ktp-pemohon.pdf\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">delete</span></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"file-row\">\n      <span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">image</span></span>\n      <span class=\"file-row__body\"><span class=\"file-row__name\">foto-lokasi-usaha.jpg</span><span class=\"file-row__meta\">1,1 MB dari 3,0 MB · 37%</span><span class=\"progress progress--thin\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Mengunggah foto-lokasi-usaha.jpg\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"37\"><span class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.37);\"></span></span></span>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Batalkan unggahan foto-lokasi-usaha.jpg\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"file-row is-error\">\n      <span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">error</span></span>\n      <span class=\"file-row__body\"><span class=\"file-row__name\">surat-pengantar-rt.pdf</span><span class=\"file-row__meta\">Unggahan gagal. Periksa koneksi lalu coba lagi.</span></span>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Coba lagi surat-pengantar-rt.pdf\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"drop\">\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">upload_file</span>\n  <span class=\"empty__title\">Lepaskan dokumen persyaratan di sini</span>\n  <span class=\"empty__body\">PDF atau gambar, masing-masing paling besar 10 MB</span>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\">Pilih berkas</button>\n  <input type=\"file\" multiple accept=\".pdf,image/*\" hidden aria-label=\"Dokumen persyaratan\">\n</div>\n<ul aria-label=\"Berkas terpilih\">\n  <li class=\"file-row\">\n    <span class=\"file-row__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">image</span></span>\n    <span class=\"file-row__body\">\n      <span class=\"file-row__name\">foto-lokasi-usaha.jpg</span>\n      <span class=\"file-row__meta\">1,1 MB dari 3,0 MB · 37%</span>\n      <span class=\"progress progress--thin\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Mengunggah foto-lokasi-usaha.jpg\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"37\"><span class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.37);\"></span></span>\n    </span>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Batalkan unggahan foto-lokasi-usaha.jpg\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"file-row is-error\">…<span class=\"file-row__meta\">Unggahan gagal. Periksa koneksi lalu coba lagi.</span>…</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- Your code: the button calls input.click(); dragover sets .is-over, dragleave and drop remove it; each file becomes a row. -->"
      },
      {
        "title": "Satu berkas, progres di sekeliling tepi",
        "desc": "Untuk satu unggahan, zona menelusuri tepinya sendiri dan menampilkan pil persentase; jejaknya menjadi hijau pada 100 %. Tekan Unggah.",
        "html": "<div class=\"drop\" id=\"fi-drop\" style=\"max-width: 520px; width: 100%;\">\n  <span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">cloud_upload</span>\n  <span class=\"empty__title\">denah-lokasi-usaha.pdf</span>\n  <span class=\"empty__body\">8,6 MB</span>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" style=\"margin-top: 8px;\" onclick=\"const d = document.getElementById('fi-drop'); import('../../js/lds.js').then((m) => { m.uploadReset(d); let p = 0; const t = setInterval(() => { p += 4 + Math.random() * 10; m.uploadProgress(d, Math.min(p, 100)); if (p >= 100) clearInterval(t); }, 220); });\">Unggah</button>\n</div>",
        "code": "import { uploadProgress, uploadReset } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n\nxhr.upload.onprogress = (e) => uploadProgress(drop, (e.loaded / e.total) * 100);\n// Starting again: uploadReset(drop)"
      }
    ]
  },
